===''H. confusus'' vs ''H. longicaudatus''===

''H. confusus'' was originally described as ''[[Banffia]] confusa'' in 1997, while ''H. longicaudatus'' was described and assigned to the new genus ''Heteromorphus'' in 1999.  The discoverers of ''B. confusa'' referred to it as ''H. confusus'' in 2002, accepting its assignment to ''Heteromorphus'' and, according to a comprehensive 2007 review of vetulicolian phylogenetics, indicating that ''H. longicaudatus'' is its junior synonym.  However, the same source also noted substantial variation among ''Heteromorphus'' specimens, and that more species (including a distinct ''H. longicaudatus'') may exist.<ref name=Aldridge2007 />



